<title>USA: BTM/Schroders chain store sales delayed until Weds.</title>
<headline>BTM/Schroders chain store sales delayed until Weds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BTM/Schroders weekly chain store sales index, normally due on Tuesday, will be released on Wednesday, September 4 at 0900 EDT/1300 GMT, according to a spokeswoman at Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd.</p>
<p>The report was rescheduled because of the U.S. Labor Day holiday on Monday.</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1868</p>
